Read HANDOFF.md on the main branch before editing. Follow it.

This repo is public. Never commit keys, codes, phone numbers, money figures, client or people names, or server addresses. Do not fake a run when a secret is missing.

Do not touch private.html, cert.html, certstudio.html, search-grok.html, or search.webmanifest. Keep js/nirvana.js, js/saveapp.js, and js/ara-install.js working.

Deputy is read-only. Use Desk’s existing roster call and show its real result. Do not write to Deputy and do not invent a shift check.

Use a branch and a pull request against gh-pages. Do not change a data source or backend URL.
